  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="poem" xml:id="f31_vi_bruto_minore_p_62">
        <pb n="62" facs="#F31062"/>
                <head>VI. BRUTO MINORE.</head>
        <lg>
<l n="112">Di vil caterva? In peggio</l>
        <l n="113">Precipitano i tempi; e mal s’affida</l>
        <l n="114"><app><lem wit="#F31">A</lem><rdg wit="#B24 #B26 #N35 #R18">A putridi</rdg></app> putridi nepoti</l>
        <l n="115">L’onor d’egregie menti e la suprema</l>
        <l n="116">De’ miseri vendetta. A me dintorno</l>
        <l n="117">Le penne il bruno augello avido roti;</l>
        <l n="118">Prema la fera, e <app><lem wit="#F31">’l</lem><rdg wit="#B24 #B26 #N35 #R18">Il nembo</rdg></app> nembo</l>
        <l n="119">Tratti l’ignota spoglia;</l>
        <l n="120">E l’aura il nome e la memoria accoglia. </poem></l>
        </lg>
      </div>
    </body>
